    "['locator [parameter1] ipv6-prefix [parameter2] [parameter3] static [parameter4]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'segment-routing srv6', 'parent_command': ['router isis [parameter1]', 'mpls traffic-eng router-id [parameter1]'], 'root': 'router isis [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': 'Here\\'s the translated Cisco equivalent command for the Huawei SRv6 locator configuration:\\n\\n##\\nsegment-routing srv6\\n locator as1\\n  prefix 2001:db8:15::/64 static 32\\n##\\n\\nThis Cisco command:\\n1. Creates an SRv6 locator named \"as1\"\\n2. Assigns the prefix 2001:db8:15::/64\\n3. Sets the static block size to 32 (similar to Huawei\\'s static 32 parameter)\\n4. Uses the same naming convention (as1) and IPv6 prefix as the original configuration', 'trans_template': 'segment-routing srv6'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'locator as1', 'parent_command': ['router isis [parameter1]', 'mpls traffic-eng router-id [parameter1]'], 'root': 'router isis [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': 'Here\\'s the translated Cisco equivalent command for the Huawei SRv6 locator configuration:\\n\\n##\\nsegment-routing srv6\\n locator as1\\n  prefix 2001:db8:15::/64 static 32\\n##\\n\\nThis Cisco command:\\n1. Creates an SRv6 locator named \"as1\"\\n2. Assigns the prefix 2001:db8:15::/64\\n3. Sets the static block size to 32 (similar to Huawei\\'s static 32 parameter)\\n4. Uses the same naming convention (as1) and IPv6 prefix as the original configuration', 'trans_template': 'locator as1'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'prefix 2001:db8:15::/64 static 32', 'parent_command': ['router isis [parameter1]', 'mpls traffic-eng router-id [parameter1]'], 'root': 'router isis [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': 'Here\\'s the translated Cisco equivalent command for the Huawei SRv6 locator configuration:\\n\\n##\\nsegment-routing srv6\\n locator as1\\n  prefix 2001:db8:15::/64 static 32\\n##\\n\\nThis Cisco command:\\n1. Creates an SRv6 locator named 